(1,'KEEP',[I],'theory','Earth-surface paths under completely specified sun/shadow velocity rules','All three speed rules and direction relative to the shadow are given. Spherical geometry, Earth rotation/solar direction and kinematic ODE integration determine trajectories/regimes with horizon/night conventions declared.'),
