(27,'KEEP',[I,VI,IX],'data_analysis','Frequency statistics of classical charge radiation in random electrostatic forces','Newton charged motion, local electrostatic curvature and ordinary radiation/wave frequency relate a declared random-field ensemble to a frequency distribution. Independent sources alone do not fix covariance or even confinement, which may be reported as model/data insufficiency; no quantum transition law is demanded.'),
(28,'KEEP',[VI,VII],'theory','Vanishing smooth finite-energy static source-free fields on all space','Static Maxwell div/curl conditions and the supplied E=plus/minus B imply harmonic fields. Integration/finite-energy harmonic uniqueness on all R3 proves zero; the named Bogomolny label supplies no extra prerequisite.'),
